  "notes": "USAGE:\n{変異|へんい} is primarily used in scientific and medical contexts, particularly in biology and genetics. It became widely known during discussions of viral mutations. As a する verb, it describes the process of mutating.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {遺伝子|いでんし}{変異|へんい}: genetic mutation\n- {変異|へんい}{株|かぶ}: mutant strain, variant\n- {突然変異|とつぜんへんい}: sudden mutation\n- {変異|へんい}{体|たい}: mutant (organism)",
